      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<size=200%><b>What''s New</b></size>


    <b><size=150%>NEW LETHAL APE
    MARES 2026 PART 2</size></b>

    We just added a new update with map changes
    and more, go check it out!


    <b><size=150%>NEW BANSHEE MONSTER</size></b>

    If
    your inside the Outdoors, go find a grave with the name banshee and wait for
    15-30 seconds and beware, it will find you and it will get you...


    <b><size=150%>NEW
    SEASON PASS ITEMS</size></b>

    New season pass with two tiers!, Free - Allows
    you to get some free cosmetics, XP and GD, or Premium - Unlock new skins bundles
    and more!, All obtainable by purchasing it in spawn to the right, you can also
    complete the Quests on the same board to unlock more XP allowing you to level
    up!


    <b><size=150%>NEW MOD MENU</size></b>

    We just added a new seasonal
    Mod menu that changes its look each season!, it has a new page thats SUPER op, 
    $29.99 in spawn and shop now!


    <b><size=150%>NEW PUMKIN LAUNCHER</size></b>

    Knock
    back players, and monsters with it, HAVE FUN!


    <b><size=150%>PROMO CODE</size></b>

    <color=#FFD700>AUGUST-2D62F9</color>

    <size=90%>Get
    <b>10% off</b> THE BRAND NEW BUNDLES</size>


'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 87e620be83eb9d04e8800ff4248bf302, type: 2}
