  m_text: "=========================\n<b>- DEV @ LA - </b>\n\nHello everybody my
    name is Fiji\n\nHere is what I do,\n\nI make alot of the maps and stuff\n\n-
    Most map expansions are made by me\n\n-I love working for this game :) \n\n============[EXTRA]=============\n\n-
    ! FUN FACT !    I used to work for many games\nbut the working condisions was
    super bad, until i started working for Monke Dev!!!\n\nFiji was here"
