  m_text: '=========================

    <b>- OWNER @ LA - </b>


    Hi gangalang,
    I''m Monke Dev


    Here is what I do,


    I Create the game, mostly every
    asset is made by me


    - Most of the cosmetics and bundles are made by me,
    same with other stuff


    -I Basically do everything lol, most of the work
    is done by me


    ============[EXTRA]=============


    - ! FUN FACT !   
    My old name was Sigma Cat studios but me and sigma cat studios are the same person'
