  m_text: '=========================

    <b>- Contributer @ LA - </b>


    Hello
    bois, my name is MXME


    Here is what I do,


    Most of the jumpscares and
    monsters are made by me


    - I made 1 or 2 bundles and i come up with alot
    of ideas


    - If you see me ingame im usually sleeping ingame as its very
    funny!!!


    ============[EXTRA]=============


    - ! FUN FACT !    I made
    like 80% of the monsters in this game same with jumpscares :) '
